docs {
  # Generate Voice
  
  Generate dubbed audio files from subtitle text using AI voice synthesis.
  
  ## Endpoint
  POST /api/dubbing/generate
  
  ## Authentication
  Currently not required (commented out in code)
  
  ## Request Body
  ```json
  {
    "subtitles": [
      {
        "sourceText": "Original text",
        "targetText": "Translated text",
        "index": 0,
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 5.0
      }
    ],
    "config": {
      "model": "gpt-4o",
      "voice": "th-TH-NiwatNeural",
      "voiceType": "edge-tts",
      "toLanguage": "th-TH"
    },
    "videoDetails": {
      "videoId": "youtube_video_id",
      "title": "Video title",
      "subtitleLevel": 1
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Subtitle Item Fields
  - `sourceText`: Original subtitle text
  - `targetText`: Translated text to convert to speech
  - `index`: Subtitle sequence number
  - `start`: Start time in seconds
  - `end`: End time in seconds
  
  ### Config Fields
  - `model`: AI model used for translation (optional, can be null)
  - `voice`: Voice ID from voices list (e.g., "th-TH-NiwatNeural")
  - `voiceType`: Voice provider (currently "edge-tts")
  - `toLanguage`: Target language code (e.g., "th-TH")
  
  ### Video Details Fields
  - `videoId`: Video identifier (e.g., YouTube video ID)
  - `title`: Video title
  - `subtitleLevel`: Subtitle track level
  
  ## Description
  Converts translated subtitle text into speech audio files using Edge TTS.
  Supports audio caching to save time and resources for repeated requests.
  
  ## Response (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "message": "dubbingGenerationCompleted",
    "videoId": "nWwvRuPQois",
    "totalFiles": 3,
    "successCount": 3,
    "cachedCount": 0,
    "generatedCount": 3,
    "errorCount": 0,
    "audioFiles": [
      {
        "index": 12,
        "url": "https://tofu-dubbing-space.sgp1.digitaloceanspaces.com/...",
        "text": "Translated text",
        "start": 189.96,
        "end": 202.92,
        "cached": false,
        "responseType": "prx"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  - `message`: Status message (usually "dubbingGenerationCompleted")
  - `videoId`: Video identifier
  - `totalFiles`: Total number of subtitle items processed
  - `successCount`: Number of successfully generated audio files
  - `cachedCount`: Number of audio files loaded from cache
  - `generatedCount`: Number of newly generated audio files
  - `errorCount`: Number of failed generations
  - `audioFiles`: Array of audio file objects with URLs and timing info
- `audioFiles[].responseType`: Debug source for each generated segment (`"prx"` = proxy, `"ip"` = direct/no proxy)
  
  ## Use Cases
  - Generate dubbing audio for YouTube videos
  - Convert translated subtitles to speech
  - Create multilingual voice-overs
}

